{{STACK_SUMMARY}} · tests: {{TEST_FRAMEWORK}}{{#IF MIGRATION_TOOL}} · migrations: {{MIGRATION_TOOL}} in `{{MIGRATION_DIR}}`{{/IF}}. Code: {{PROJECT_STRUCTURE}}. Adding anything outside this list needs a recorded decision in `{{STATE_FILE}}`.

## Commands
- **Full check, once per story:** `{{CHECK_COMMAND}}` (self-contained: {{CHECK_PRECONDITIONS}}). It must be green before a story is done (`build-loop` owns the rule).
{{#IF FRONTEND_CHECK_COMMAND}}- **Frontend:** `{{FRONTEND_CHECK_COMMAND}}`.{{/IF}}
{{#IF MIGRATION_TOOL}}- **Schema changes** cycle migrations clean: `{{MIGRATION_UP}}` → `{{MIGRATION_DOWN}}` → `{{MIGRATION_UP}}`.{{/IF}}

## Project invariants
{{INVARIANTS}}
- **Errors:** a single uniform error contract, applied everywhere; plain-language user-facing errors that state impact + next action; no stack traces or secrets to clients; never show success unless the operation completed.
{{#IF TOKENS_FILE}}- **UI components:** semantic tokens from `{{TOKENS_FILE}}` only — no raw hex/px. Status carried by icon/text, never color alone.{{/IF}}
{{#IF MIGRATION_TOOL}}- **Schema:** obey design {{SCHEMA_SECTION}} — the standard column set, CHECK-constrained states, and FK delete behavior that never loses history to a cascade.{{/IF}}

## Commits
Format `{{COMMIT_FORMAT}}`, then a wrapped body saying what changed and why, on `{{BRANCH}}`, every message ending with the `Co-Authored-By` trailer from the environment rules. Commit `{{STATE_FILE}}` with the story.
